WEBVTT

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:14.730
What do we have here?
"To Miss Lina Inverse"...

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:17.500
But who knows I'm here now?

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.100
Who sent this to me?

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:22.080
Someone named "Filia".

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.070
Who's that?

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:42.930
...and in conclusion my fellow rulers,
whom I have gathered here.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.940
One thing is now clear!

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.000
The disappearance of the
Monster race's barrier...

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:53.040
...inside of which we have lived
for the past thousand years...

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.280
...is now an indisputable fact!

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.710
If the Monster race's
barrier is gone...

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.780
...doesn't that mean we can
now travel to the outer world?

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.790
But... For a barrier we've
never had any means...

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.690
...of destroying before
to suddenly vanish!

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:11.760
Look for yourselves.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.860
That pillar of light we see is
only one piece of evidence...

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:17.160
...that the barrier has vanished.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.200
But what IS that pillar of light?

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:22.260
I don't know.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.600
The legends and literature
we are familiar with...

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.870
...say nothing of such phenomena.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:30.910
I hope it doesn't foretell some
calamity is about to happen.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.880
Exactly! We can't just
sit back and ignore it!

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:37.680
The kingdoms of the outer world may
be preparing to launch an invasion!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.090
For that reason! We of
the Kingdom of Seyruun...

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.890
...propose the dispatching
of a peace delegation!

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:49.830
I ask for the cooperation of the
other kingdoms in this endeavor!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:55.960
Now, then, in my father's place,
I, Amelia Wil Tesla Seyruun...

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.440
...will explain
this plan to you all.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.210
Hold it, Gourry! I grabbed
that sashimi for myself!

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.750
What're you talking about, Lina?!
It goes bad if you don't eat it fast!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.610
Man, you gotta love seaport food!
This fish is fantastic!

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.990
Really! Really! It's the best!

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.120
Ah! I am feelin' satisfied!

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.950
Considering we haven't been to the
outer world in a thousand years...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.760
...those ships are pretty small.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:26.500
You think so? By the way,
Lina, can I ask you something?

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:27.330
Here it comes...

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:29.970
What's the "outer world"?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:34.000
Ooh! You're asking me AGAI N,
poached eggs for brains?!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.280
Okay, listen up!

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:40.340
This is the area we live in, got it?

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:44.650
And the coast of this kingdom
is where we are now.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:48.680
Until now, we've
never left this area...

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.730
...but since the
situation's now changed...

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.420
...we have to go investigate
what the outer world's like.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.370
That why a bunch of different kings
are sending out a delegation.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.770
You sure know a lot about this.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.470
You must have heard all the
talk about it before now!

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.340
Have I?

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.770
Yeah, you have!

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:08.610
So, why hasn't anyone gone
out there before now?

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:13.850
You're missing the
basic problem, aren't you?

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.820
Okay, I may be wasting my time,
but I'll explain it to you.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:20.380
One thousand years ago,
the dark lord Shabranigdo...

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.150
...was reborn in the
War of the Monsters' Fall.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:25.250
Ever since then, there's been
a high-level magical barrier...

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.990
...around this region we live in that
the dark lord's followers erected.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:31.330
Because of it, going out to
or coming in from...

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.170
...the outer world
has been impossible.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.470
However, this era has seen
a dramatic change arise!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.940
Due to the exploits of a
beautiful sorcery genius...

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.980
...the dark lord's faithful servant
Phibrizzo has been destroyed!

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:48.920
As a result, the barrier around
our land has disappeared...

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.920
...and travel to the outer
world is now possible!

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.320
Wow... Must've been
some sorceress.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.490
ME, you idiot!
I was talking about ME!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.930
Besides that, there's also
that pillar of light...

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:04.690
Ever since it happened, we've been
able to see that pillar of light.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:06.900
I wonder what it is.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.240
Good grief,
you two never change.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.710
I haven't seen
you guys in a while.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.040
Zel!

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:14.600
Zelgadis!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.910
It has been a while
since then, hasn't it?

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.380
You doing all right, Zel?

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.150
I suppose. And you guys?

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:29.360
I can't imagine
you two ever looking sad.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.890
Are you looking for a fight
so soon after getting here?!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.090
Uh, no.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.790
So, did you come to see the boats
sail off to the outer world, too, Zel?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.800
Yeah...

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.600
Oh! Lemme guess!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:45.030
You're thinking there might be some
magical item in the outer world...

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:46.300
...than can cure your body, right?

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:50.550
Yeah...
Well, with a body like mine...

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:53.610
Yeah. It's hard for you, isn't it?

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.680
It's nothing. I'm patient.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:01.850
But they're sending delegates
from lots of kingdoms, right?

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.860
Can you just slip in with them?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:09.560
Maybe. And if that doesn't work,
I can try taking my own boat.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.230
I see you haven't lost
that never give up spirit.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:15.800
So, what are you guys
doing here, anyway?

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:19.700
Well, we're here to check out
an offer I got in this letter.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.400
An offer?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:24.310
I've never heard of the
person who sent it to us...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.440
...but the pay they're
offering can't be beat!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.040
I'm prepared to find out
it's all a prank, though.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.280
Who's there?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.930
I am the one who sent that offer.

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.320
You mean, you're?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:51.070
Yes. I am the "Filia" who sent
you that letter, Miss Lina.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:54.340
And you must be
Mr. Zelgadis Graywords.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.810
And you, Mr. Gourry Gabriev.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.870
So, you've done some
checking up on us.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:06.180
Yes, at least as far as how you
destroyed Hellmaster Phibrizzo.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:08.380
Now I get it...

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:12.390
So, knowing what you do about us,
what kind of offer do you have?

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.890
Well...

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.700
I've come to talk to you to confirm
how powerful you really are.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.410
How powerful we are?

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:24.240
For what, exactly?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.030
Well, you see...

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.580
W-WWW-What are you doing,
Gourry?!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.550
It... It's not what you think!
I was just looking in here!

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:48.220
What... What...
What just happened?!

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.200
Ow!

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:00.240
Serves you right for
pulling a stunt like that!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.940
But, I'm telling you!
Ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.210
You gutless!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.420
But why did you?
You know, do that?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.970
Were you really that interested
in flipping her skirt up?

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.920
F- Flipping her skirt?!
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:14.220
I just wanted to
see what was in there!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:17.190
Isn't that usually the point
of flipping a girl's skirt?

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.130
NO! I saw a tail!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.160
A tail?

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.100
Yeah! That girl had a tail!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:26.800
Hm... And that's why you
looked under her skirt. I see.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.830
I thought you'd finally given up on
Lina for not being sexy at all...

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.540
...and were finally going
after another girl.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.100
Hold it, buddy!
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.620
What is this thing?!
It weighs a ton!

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.210
Besides being very
attractive, that girl...

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.590
...swung this around
without breaking a sweat.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:48.060
Meaning, at the very least,
she's special somehow.

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:51.220
Well, we can't be too shocked at
running into...

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.260
...someone with a
tail in this world.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:55.320
There are werewolves
and fish people, right?

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.530
A girl with a tail is a VERY
suspicious person, though.

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:04.900
Do you also get the feeling we're
involved in big trouble now?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:08.210
I guess so.

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:11.410
I wonder if we'll even get
that money she promised.

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:30.670
My fellow inhabitants
of this land!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.510
For the first time in a
thousand years,

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:36.240
we will set foot into the
outer world!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:42.350
At the moment, we cannot
know what is going on out there.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:46.880
Will we be greeted with good will?
Or will it be just the opposite?

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:51.220
Countless dangers
may await us there!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.130
But equal in number
to the dangers...

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:59.360
No, in GREATER number,
are new possibilities!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:03.870
And so now we take that
first step out to find them!

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.640
Bring forth the map!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.210
To avoid the desert that
stretches to the south of us...

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:12.580
...our fleet will be sailing
south from this coast.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:15.810
Our flagship will be the "Ceiphied"
from the Holy Kingdom of Seyruun.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:16.550
The second ship...

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:21.250
What do you know! The guy who put
this delegation together was Phil!

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:24.960
Hey, isn't that Amelia over there?
Look, Zel! It's Amelia!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.900
Amelia! Amelia!
It's me! It's me!

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:33.500
It... It couldn't be.
I'm just hearing things.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.730
That must be it.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.210
Looks like she can't hear us.

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:41.270
Fine! We'll just catch up with her
later, and when we do!

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:44.710
I suppose, but... What about
that girl Filia from yesterday?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.020
Things have gotten
a bit hazy since then.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.580
I'm right here if you want me.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:58.020
Filia?

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:00.090
Uh, the tail woman?!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.500
Look, about yesterday.
I'm terribly sorry.

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:07.460
This girl is definitely
someone special.

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.810
Hey! There's no tail on her!

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.850
She definitely had
one when I saw her!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.640
You aren't lying, are you?

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:19.810
Excuse me.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.950
I believe I forgot something
when I left yesterday.

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:26.290
Might you still have it?

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:27.860
You mean this thing?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.730
Thank you so much! For a while
I didn't know what I'd do!

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:33.730
Oh, thank goodness!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:36.930
Anyway, might we continue
our talk from yesterday?

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:41.260
Sure. It was about a job that
paid a special guarantee, right?

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:45.330
A favor beyond just finding
out how powerful we are.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:51.310
Yes. That's why I'm going to
have to test all of your power.

00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:59.220
Huh? Huh? Huh?
Hold it! Hold it! What?!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.090
She disappeared.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:14.530
Test our powers?
What is she planning?

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.810
I guess she really
is someone special.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:25.010
In the name ofJustice and
Seyruun, take to the sea!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.640
Take to the sea!

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:31.180
Set sail!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.710
Hey there, Amelia!
Long time, no see!

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:00.580
Li- Li- Li!

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.220
Who are you? I don't
think we've ever met!

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.850
What are you
talking about?! Hey!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.260
Oh, Miss Lina!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.490
Phil!

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:24.800
M- Miss Lina... I'm doing official
business. Can we talk later?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.640
Why so unfriendly all of a sudden?

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.190
A golden dragon!

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.590
Why NOW, of all times?!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.860
Hold it! Is this the
test of our powers?

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:50.800
What?!
You mean this is your fault?!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:53.570
Yes. It seems there's
no doubt about it!

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:00.500
Look out!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:08.120
It's pretty certain we're
the dragon's targets!

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:11.120
What's it thinking? Doing this
with so many people around!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.280
What'll we do?!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.390
There's only one thing TO do!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.250
Let's go, Gourry! Zel! Amelia!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.590
Of course! The ship!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.160
All right! We'll lead that
thing onto the open sea!!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.700
Why do I have to
get caught in all this?!

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.070
Gourry! Take the wheel!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:31.910
Right!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:33.310
Hold it!

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:36.640
This is MY ship! My ship is
like a part of my own body!

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.350
You can't just take it!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.410
She's all yours!

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:48.990
Man, now THOSE guys are
honest with themselves!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:52.050
Seyruun sailors aren't
that tough, are they?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.160
Me! I'll take command.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:58.400
All hands, take positions! Signal
the other ships! Justice is with us!

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.640
All ships, defensive formation!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.970
Take us to combat
speed one! Deploy oars!

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.680
Why me?!

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:18.720
Here it comes!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:20.490
Combat speed two!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:29.170
Prepare anti-air defenses!
Sorcerer team, forward!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.140
FIRE!!!

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.330
FIRE... BALL!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.610
Laser Breath!

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.320
BURST FLARE!!!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:04.160
Golden dragons are as
tough as I've heard!

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:05.590
It's making a fool of me!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.960
Is that my cue?!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.170
Light, come forth!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:19.150
What do you
think you're doing?!

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.320
It's coming right for us!

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:28.660
It's not playing around.
Okay, fine!

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:31.330
Then I'm not gonna pull
any punches, either!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.870
RUNE FLARE!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:45.470
All right! It worked!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:52.010
Miss Lina!

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.950
Leave this to me!
Gourry! Hard to port!

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.380
Which way is "port"?!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.750
No! Other way! Other way!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.650
SEA BLAST!

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.160
Look! It's running away!

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:16.400
Oh, no, you don't!
After it! Hard to port!

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.840
Aye, aye, sir!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:21.840
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows..."

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.180
"Buried in the flow of time..."

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.810
"In thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness!"

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:30.120
"Let all the fools who stand
before us be destroyed..."

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:33.920
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.920
DRAGON SLAVE!

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.080
Victory!

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.480
You did it, Miss Lina!

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.210
Lina won't even lose
face to a golden dragon.

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:02.340
Anyway, let's get
back to the port fast...

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:07.020
...so I can find that Filia girl and
REALLY make her pay for this!

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.860
Tsuna... Tsuna...
Tsuna... Tsuna...

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:12.560
Tsuna?

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.260
TSUNAMI!!!

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:22.400
WHAT'S HAPPENING?!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.220
All I can see is ocean.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:44.290
All the other ships
must have been sunk!

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.190
Uh-huh...

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.390
Dammit!

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:49.560
There's nothing to be done.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.060
Now what?

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.870
L- Look...

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:59.080
Th- That's the port we just left?

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:02.240
I think the tsunami your
Dragon Slave caused must have...

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:04.210
It's a total mess.

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:05.720
What do we do, Miss Lina?

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.950
All right! It's decided! We run...

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.150
Uh, I mean, we set out
for the outer world!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.900
The ship's destination
hasn't changed!

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.960
We shall carry on and take our
first step into an unknown world!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:22.430
Are you sure about this?

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.990
We could still Ray Wing
our way back, you know!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:29.910
Oh, quit whining! You guys want to
see the outer world, too, right?

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:34.640
Amelia, you want to spread Justice
and fight evil there, right?

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.080
Y- Yeah...

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:39.150
And Zelgadis,
I KNOWyou want to go!

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:42.450
Yes. I'm the sort who's
always chasing his dreams.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:43.780
And you, Gourry?

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:46.290
Hm...
Well, I guess I'll tag along.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:50.590
Okay, now the world's our stage
as we set off for a new journey!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:51.820
LET'S GO!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.130
Miss Lina!

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:56.220
Didn't you hear me?!
A new journey!

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:58.290
LET'S GO!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:20:59.970
Say it louder!

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:24.180
Huh?! Say what?!

00:22:24.260 --> 00:22:26.190
We're the representatives
of the human race?!

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:28.850
What do you mean we
have to save the world?!

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:32.290
Next time: " Doubtful?
A Letter From Home!"

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:35.460
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
